abstract: >-
  Machine-assisted Hindi (hi-Deva-IN) working edition of 158 accepted frozen
  Open Logic Project source files, representing 59,955 source words and built
  as a 211-page searchable, rendered, and visually checked reader. This is not
  a completed 722-file translation or a claim of human review.
